# Keep the integrity-checked AI guidance files byte-stable across clones and
# checkouts regardless of each developer's core.autocrlf setting. The SQL Nexus
# MCP server verifies these files with a fixed SHA-256 hash at startup, so their
# on-disk line endings must never be rewritten by Git. Pinned to CRLF to match the
# hashes stored in SqlNexus.McpServer/FileIntegrity.cs.
.github/agents/sql-nexus-diagnostic.agent.md eol=crlf
AI/Skills/*.md                               eol=crlf
